Because slop code cannot be copyrighted, this project is entirely Public
Domain. It was been extruded by Claude and is therefore derived work of an
unknown set of existing code, which was covered by various Copyright and
licensing terms.

In particular, a comparison with Libgcrypt 1.11.2 shows that most of the
non-cryptographic code follows that library's internal design closely.
Libgcrypt is licensed under the LGPL-2.1-or-later, and anyone
redistributing this project should assume those terms apply.
